{"unit_id": "Howthemeaning__dsh-model-settings#card-zh", "repo": "Howthemeaning/dsh-model-settings", "commit": "b13428034a0a35ce8305429fc0e9850131cb2ca6", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-model-settings 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型设置插件，在侧边栏加入模型设置面板，通过宿主设置和请求路由管理模型。它可分别配置新会话主模型、普通及 workflow 子代理模型、Goal 激活期间的回合模型和推理强度；支持全局保存热更新，也可只将模型应用到当前会话。适合希望统一管理不同会话角色模型的 DSH 用户。模型来自宿主已配置的 provider，无需额外 API key 或外部服务。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:249-290", "lib/index.js:441-510", "lib/client.js:889-900"]}
{"unit_id": "Howthemeaning__dsh-model-settings#card-en", "repo": "Howthemeaning/dsh-model-settings", "commit": "b13428034a0a35ce8305429fc0e9850131cb2ca6", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-model-settings adds a model panel to the DSH web sidebar. Configure main, subagent, and goal-round models with reasoning effort. Save globally for hot updates or apply a model to the open conversation only. It uses providers already configured in DSH.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:249-290", "lib/index.js:441-510", "lib/client.js:889-900"]}
